{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [secret-exposure]: shell read of a credential-bearing path. Reference the single environment variable an integration needs; never print secret files. [command-sha256:9f031e645bb9fd74289bb1452710a263455a8e28de6127456429890f092fef4a] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
